  "rules": [
    "Water leak: affected units come from the riser. Directly below = high risk (call). Two or more floors below = low risk (message). Cellar = check during the plumber visit. Never invent extra parties.",
    "Water leak near electrics (photo shows wet sockets or lamps): note it for the plumber. Electrician is a stage 3 extra.",
    "Heating failure: everybody on the same heating loop is affected (stage 3 scenario).",
    "Costs above owner.approval_limit_eur need owner approval (stage 3 extra). Below the limit the owner gets a message.",
    "share_with lists ROLES (plumber, electrician, heating, locksmith, isp, owner), never partner IDs. Every provider and every connector has a role from roles_for_share_with. Fields without the partner's role in share_with are withheld.",
    "Always contact a resident in their own language, with the same brand voice.",
    "Every call starts by saying it is the digital assistant of the property management (AI disclosure).",
    "Move-in: the incoming tenant gets internet live on move-in day. The ISP gets name, move-in date, unit, phone and the unit's internet_line_id, nothing else."
  ],
